<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang='en-US'><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><script>window['ec:pageId']='4179088374764072772'</script><title>CFP</title><link href="/images/favicon.ico" rel="icon" type="image/jpeg"/><link href="/css/cool.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/cfp/classic.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/menu_cfp.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<script src="/js/easy.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/menu.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/form.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/inplace.js?version=545"></script><script>EC.version='545'</script></head>
<body><table class="page" id="page"><tr style="height:1px"><td><table class="header"><tr><td class="logocell"><a href="/" title="EasyChair home page"><img class="leftlogo" src="/images/logoEC_short.png"/></a></td><td class="rolecell">EasyChair Smart CFP</td><td style="width: 99%"></td><td class="helplink"><a class="toplinks" href="/docs/home" title="User guide">User guide</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr style="height:99%"><td class="menu_and_content"><div class="menu" id="menu0"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="menu" style="position:static; visibility:visible"><tr><td class="top" id="menu1" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu1','/cfp',{&quot;a&quot;:null})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu1')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu1')" title="Main page">Home</td><td class="top" id="menu2" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu2','/cfp/choose',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu2')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu2')" title="Create a new CFP">New CFP</td><td class="top" id="menu3" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu3','/cfp/all',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu3')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu3')" title="Manage my CFPs">My CFPs</td><td class="top" id="menu4" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu4','/cfp/watchlist',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu4')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu4')" title="My CFP watchlist">Watchlist</td></tr></table></div><div class="search_row" id="cfp:search:row"><form action="/cfp/search" id="search-form"><input id="search-input" name="query" placeholder="Search" type="text"/></form></div><div class="summary"><div class="pagetitle">CFP</div></div><div class="content" id="content"><div class="subcontent"><div id="cfp" style="clear:right"><table class="title_table"><tr><td class="single"><div id="cfptitle">ICCCM 2027: The 15th International Conference on Computer and Communications Management</div><div id="cfpvenue">Shibaura Institute of Technology (TOYOSU campus), Tokyo</div><div id="cfpdateplace">Tokyo, Japan, July 9-11, 2027</div></td></tr></table><table class="date_table"><tr><td>Conference web page</td><td><a href="https://www.icccm.org/" target="_blank">https://www.icccm.org/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission link</td><td><a href="https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=icccm2027" target="_blank">https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=icccm2027</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission deadline</td><td>January 15, 2027</td></tr></table><div class="topics">Topics: <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=718515" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_navy bg_haki">communication theory</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=12300" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_fuchsia bg_yellow">networking</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=3223" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_navy bg_palegoldenrod">image processing</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=187318" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_carmin bg_bluelight">optical communication</span></a></div><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">We are happy to announce that The 15th International Conference on Computer and Communications Management (ICCCM 2027) will be held in Tokyo, Japan during July 9-11, 2027. It is hosted by Shibaura Institute of Technology, Japan. Featured with keynote speeches, invited speeches, oral presentations, poster presentations and social networking event, ICCCM 2027 welcomes the participation of anyone who is interested in the related fields.</span></span></p><h2>Submission Guidelines</h2><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Language &amp; Requirements</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">▪ English is the official language of the conference; the paper should be written and presented only in English.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">▪ Full paper-MS Word (no less than 8 pages) and Full paper-LaTeX Template (no less than 4 pages) submission is required for publication and presentation.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">▪ Paper abstract (200-400 words) submission is required for presentation only without publication.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Submission Confirmation</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">The submission will be confirmed immediately by the submission system. The conference secretary will assigned a Paper ID to the submission from <a href="mailto:icccm.org@hotmail.com" target="_blank">icccm.org@hotmail.com</a> within three working days. To ensure receipt of all correspondence from the conference, please add <a href="mailto:icccm.org@hotmail.com" target="_blank">icccm.org@hotmail.com</a> as acceptable emails to receive.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Academic Ethics</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Only work that has not been previously published at the time of the conference will be considered. Besides, ethical conduct is the most essential virtual of any academic. Hence any act of plagiarism is a totally unacceptable academic misconduct and cannot be tolerated.</span></span></p><h2>List of Topics</h2><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">• Channel Modeling and Estimation</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">• Energy Harvesting and Low Energy Communication</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">• Feedback and Two-Way Communication</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">• Holographic Surfaces and Reconfigurable Surfaces</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">• Information Theory and Channel Capacity</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">• Integrated Sensing and Communications</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">• Low Resolution Communication</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">• Scheduling and Opportunism</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">• Resource Management</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">• URLLC, Time Sensitive and Deterministic Networking</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">• Network Slicing</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">• Routing and Congestion Control</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">• Waveforms, Coding and Modulation</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">• Iterative Techniques, Detection, and Decoding</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">• ...</span></span></p><h2>Committees</h2><p><strong><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Conference Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Tok Wang Ling, National University of Singapore, Singapore</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Sergei Gorlatch, University of Muenster, Germany</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Takumi Miyoshi, Shibaura Institute of Technology, Japan</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Program Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Ljiljana Trajkovic (IEEE Fellow), Simon Fraser University, Canada</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Xingwei Wang, Northeastern University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Masato Oguchi, Ochanomizu University, Japan</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Kiyoshi Ueda, Nihon University, Japan</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Hideo Yokota, University of the Ryukyus, Japan</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Program Vice-chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Yang Yue, Xi'an Jiaotong University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Chih-Peng Fan, National Chung Hsing University, Taiwan, China</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Steering Committee</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Nobuo Funabiki, Okayama University, Japan</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Noritaka Shigei, Kagoshima University, Japan</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Publication Chair</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Shintaro Oyama, Nagoya University, Japan &amp; University of the Ryukyus, Japan</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Publicity Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Kar Peo Yar, Singapore Institute of Technology, Singapore</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Xintong Ling, Southeast University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Lau Bee Theng, Swinburne University of Technology, Malaysia</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Wararat Songpan, Khon Kaen University, Thailand</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Regional Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Meijuan Chen, Nanjing University of Posts and Telecommunications, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Alex Mathews, Bethany College, USA</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Yih-Chuan Lin, National Formosa University, Taiwan, China</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Local Organizing Chair</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Hiroaki Morino, Shibaura Institute of Technology, Japan</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Local Committees</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Taku Yamazaki, Shibaura Institute of Technology, Japan</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Manami Kanamaru, Shibaura Institute of Technology, Japan</span></span></p><h2>Publication</h2><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">All papers will be strictly double blind reviewed by the program committee, and accepted papers after proper registration and presentation will be published in the Conference Proceedings.</span></span></p><h2>Venue</h2><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Shibaura Institute of Technology (TOYOSU campus), Tokyo</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Address: 3-7-5 Toyosu, Koto-ku, Tokyo 135-8548</span></span></p><h2>Contact</h2><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">Chie Hakone</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">icccm.org@hotmail.com</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive"><span style="font-size:16px">10:30-19:00, Monday to Friday (GMT+9 Time Zone)</span></span></p></div></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class="footer">Copyright © 2002 – 2026 EasyChair</td></tr></table></body></html>
